# EBICS 3.0 bank connections

The [Bank connection settings](/settings#bank_connection) now give a clearer view of your connection and make EBICS setup much easier.

## Existing connections

All active EBICS connections have been upgraded automatically to EBICS 3.0, with stronger 4096-bit security keys where supported. Nothing is required on your side: payment imports continue as before. The [Bank connection settings](/settings#bank_connection) now show the connection health and last payment import.

## Set up a connection

If your organization is based in Switzerland or Germany and does not yet have a bank connection, EBICS setup is now guided step by step from the [Bank connection settings](/settings#bank_connection). Automatic payment imports are much more convenient than regular manual imports. For German organizations using SEPA direct debit, EBICS can also upload direct debit orders automatically.

I strongly recommend setting it up. The [EBICS setup handbook](/handbook/billing#ebics-setup) explains the steps.

Feel free to [contact me](/support) if you have any questions or need help setting it up.
